<title>SPAIN: Spain economic growth goes with price drop-Montoro.</title>
<headline>Spain economic growth goes with price drop-Montoro.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's economic growth is compatible with a reduction in inflation, Economic Secretary Cristobal Montoro told journalists on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;A survey of business views confirms that this growth, in other words, this increase in sales, is in a manner that is compatible with a drop in inflation,&quot; Montoro said.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
